{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26217","headline":"宫词 · 殷尧藩","name":"宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悄悄深宫不见人，倚阑惟见石麒麟。\n芙蓉帐冷愁长夜，翡翠帘垂隔小春。\n天远难通青鸟信，风寒欲动锦花茵。\n夜深怕有羊车过，自起笼灯看雪纹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}